- `.dashboard-ready-shell` fixed bottom-16 -> change to bottom-24? Pill height ~62px, so bottom-24 (96px) leaves a little gap above pill. Good.
- `.chat-composer-shell` sticky bottom-14 -> bottom-20 (80px) leaves small gap. good.
- `.chat-page` pb-14 -> pb-24 to allow scroll past.
- `.chat-jump-bottom` absolute bottom-4 inside scroll area, not affected.

